//   Players: 1v1.
//   Goal: Prove zigzag prevents single-shooter enfilade.
// Tick budget: 600 ticks (10s @ 60 Hz) — long enough to dig at least one
// segment + cross a boundary so VAL-M9B-COVER-002 observes a
// trench.cover_state_changed.
